From: "Ryan X. Charles" <ryan@ryanxcharles.com>
Date: Sat, 19 Sep 2026 14:09:06 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Make Austin Night the RedVim default

Tokyo lends its syntax, Austin lends the glow,
Sodium lights the numbers as the night winds blow.
Lost themes come home; your chosen colors stay,
And readable comments finally get their say.
